.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace
.editorconfig

# Test coverage
coverage/
*.lcov
